# ─── Planner/inspector model checkpoints ──────────────────────────────────────
# Canonical checkpoints remain tracked for clone-and-test speed (~4MB total
# after deduplication of *_real.pt variants). Large experiment sweeps stay
# untracked. Future large models should be published as GitHub Release assets
# with SHA256 manifest (see models.sha256) rather than force-added blobs.
planner/model.pt
planner/results/*.pt
# Deduplicated variants removed (see Engineering Elevation Blueprint §5.2)
inspector/*_real.pt
planner/*_real.pt
# Fail-safe: any new .pt blob over 500KB is blocked by pre-commit check-added-large-files
*.pt
!inspector/anomaly_model.pt
!inspector/side_channel_model.pt
!planner/model_ddp_v3.pt
!planner/model_gpu_v3.pt
!planner/rl_agent.pt

